    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "ANO6t",
      "x": 47,
      "y": -2782,
      "name": "cmp/WorkspaceMenu",
      "context": "SessionWorkspaceMenu (pstdio-dashboard/src/modules/sessions/components/session-workspace-menu.tsx). SearchableMenu width 280, radius 8, surface $ds-elevated on a $ds-border hairline — elevation by surface, not shadow, per the system's flat rule. Menu padding 6 so rows inset and their 6px radius reads. Search row only renders when workspaces.length > 10. Rows are single-line: GitBranch icon + workspace.title, no description. Default workspace (root repo) is pinned first, rest newest-first. Empty state: 'No workspaces', compact row, 16px icon, disabled.",
      "theme": {
