                  "fill": "$ds-fg",
                  "content": "Mode, resource, panel — and the slot decides",
                  "lineHeight": 1.05,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-display",
                  "fontSize": 44,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "kPxQY",
                  "name": "Sub",
                  "fill": "$ds-fg-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1240,
                  "content": "A project contains everything. Inside it, exactly one resource is selected, and a resource owns its layout. A panel lives in a slot — and the slot, not the panel, decides how long it lives and how it behaves. Only main and the bottom panel sit under the breadcrumb; the action tray, sidenav, side panel and status tray flank it, visibly project-owned.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 16,
