                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Sessions can exist outside of resources, which is exactly why the session panel is side-panel-only. It never sits under a breadcrumb, so it never implies it belongs to the workspace you happen to be standing in. Bubblify it and only its position changes — its Context files and Run parameters menus travel with it.",
