                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1240,
                  "content": "Because slots carry behavior, a mode choosing its slots is choosing what the workbench can do — not just how it looks. Design mode drops the sidenav and the bottom panel, so there is no tree to navigate and nothing resource-owned can hide. Only the side panel survives on the right, because it never belonged to the resource in the first place.",
