                  "fill": "$ds-fg-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1100,
                  "content": "Six slots. The action tray and sidenav flank on the left, the side panel on the right, the status tray beneath — all project-owned, all outside the breadcrumb. Between them sits the resource column: a breadcrumb header naming the selection, over a main slot that cannot be hidden and a bottom panel that can. What is under the breadcrumb belongs to the selection and resets with it.",
