    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "rLiMP",
      "x": 707,
      "y": -2782,
      "name": "cmp/StatusRing",
      "context": "Linear-style state ring. Reads run lifecycle as a filling circle before the label: Draft (dashed ring) → Queued (open ring) → Running (half pie) → Needs review (three-quarter pie) → Passed (filled + check) → Cancelled (filled + x). Driven entirely by the `ring` theme axis; colour comes from $ds-state-* so it re-themes with mode.\n\nBuilt from four mutually exclusive marks toggled by boolean tokens — Ring (open, $ring-solid), Disc (filled, $ring-filled), Dash 1-8 ($ring-dash), plus Pie ($ring-pie) and Glyph ($ring-glyph) on top. innerRadius is LITERAL on purpose: binding a number variable to innerRadius resolves wrong (0.76 comes back as 0.0076, collapsing the ring into a solid disc), so do not re-introduce $ring-inner.\n\nFixed 16x16 — children are absolutely positioned, so overriding the root size will not scale them. Intended as the leading icon inside cmp/StatusIndicator.",
      "theme": {
        "ring": "progress",
        "mode": "dark"
      },
      "reusable": true,
      "width": 16,
      "height": 16,
      "layout": "none",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "ellipse",
          "id": "wAyBK",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Ring (open)",
          "enabled": "$ring-solid",
          "innerRadius": 0.76,
          "fill": "$ring-color",
          "width": 16,
          "height": 16
        },
        {
          "type": "ellipse",
          "id": "hwgcw",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Disc (filled)",
          "enabled": "$ring-filled",
          "fill": "$ring-color",
          "width": 16,
          "height": 16
        },
        {
          "type": "ellipse",
          "id": "NhaGo",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Dash 1",
          "enabled": "$ring-dash",
          "innerRadius": 0.76,
          "sweepAngle": -30,
          "fill": "$ring-color",
          "width": 16,
          "height": 16
        },
        {
